I followed `/middle` and delivered the next primitives fix. :codex-annotation{index="1"}

Split sheet verification now rejects malformed Jev rights, producer probability, and risk answers. When a later judgment is invalid, the UI clears the earlier advisory instead of continuing to display it. The fix is pushed to `main` as [`ac644a7d8`](https://github.com/indii-music-founder/indii-music-founder/commit/ac644a7d8dd54b7a3de65661feeef780d327997a).

All 241 focused tests, touched-file lint, and the test quality scan passed. The [exact-SHA CI run](https://github.com/indii-music-founder/indii-music-founder/actions/runs/41568557021) has passed its test matrix, lint, and remote TypeScript check; the studio build is still running, so deployment is **not yet verified**. The remaining-primitives plan records this fix and the next campaign bid finding.

